文自行组织、竞争和协作完成任务，而无需统一的调度者。","title":"Agensh: Scaling Organizational Intelligence to 1,024 Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_da7aa4ad280288b6f66b37a4ea5628e06663c9809b03dfff8ab11376599a0281","internal_url":"/posts/20260924-arxiv-speakermem-r1-speaker-centered-dual-track-memory-f-1-1ef9cc7a7e/","observation_id":"obs_1ef9cc7a7ec923797fc1bd29a3c2ab6a522a776263cef1f59259746ade101f06","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:56:12Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该文提出一种面向多方对话的双轨记忆框架，一轨保存说话者的原始语句，另一轨提取并维护人物级和群体级的状态信息，在查询时依据实体、事件和时间将两轨证据融合，以解决对话中角色归属和关系演化的难题。","title":"SpeakerMem-R1: Speaker-Centered Dual-Track Memory for Multi-Party Dialogue"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_55a64230f4751921a419b3c552a933cbd29ea47eeb32e17c442c1226ad092fbe","internal_url":"/posts/20260924-arxiv-cliffcompaction-cost-efficient-compaction-for-long-1-f20fc2a20e/","observation_id":"obs_f20fc2a20e714d36bf2e1ba03d420e0a94acf7058a14908b3d61b4564cdca8ce","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:55:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"CliffCompaction 是一种自动压缩技术，用于在保持或提升任务表现的同时，降低处理大规模上下文时的成本。它仅通过截断或丢弃原始内容实现压缩，避免重新表述导致的信息漂移。","title":"CliffCompaction: Cost-Efficient Compaction for Long-Horizon Coding Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5a72d9ab512c38d471ff4932e5d913753dbaab58410c503d1a1ef6048c1460b1","internal_url":"/posts/20260923-blogs_podcasts-claude-opus-55-is-now-available-on-aws-0-7322241f50/","observation_id":"obs_7322241f50811c86635013fca1c2dec777d6bc59ec939d3fe261730326e52f31","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:28:01Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇公告，介绍 Anthropic 在 Amazon Bedrock 与 Claude Platform 上线最新的 Opus 5.5 模型，强调其在 token 利用率、费用以及安全分类器方面的提升，并提供接入示例。","title":"Claude Opus 5.5 is now available on AWS"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c734b875131ccb7de35ffe5ece16af754bb07787cc0cdfcede22bd1d1222ba2d","internal_url":"/posts/20260923-hacker_news-claud